onment while remaining centrally connected to the city. Residents enjoy easy access to top international schools, luxury retail destinations, fine dining venues, cycling tracks, and landscaped walkways, all within a secure and family-friendly setting.<br> <br> Connectivity:<br> <br> ⦁ 15 Minutes to Downtown Dubai<br> ⦁ 25 Minutes to Dubai Marina<br> ⦁ 30 Minutes to Dubai International Airport<br> ⦁ 40 Minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport<br> <br> Crest Grande delivers a resort-inspired lifestyle with the perfect blend of luxury, convenience, and waterfront serenity in the heart of Dubai.","longitude":55.2856612,"negotiator_id":"11944","negotiator_mapping":"patrick@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":2499999,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"sales","slug":"2-bedroom-apartment-for-sale-in-crest-grande-sobhahartland-mohammed-bin-rashid-city-dubai","status":"For Sale","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/ca3/va8kblphxn2v23zwxf8h4q614yl8vv49/download.png","title":"2 bedroom apartment for sale","extra":{"views":"","cheques":null,"project":null,"bitrix_id":"1478658","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"71450781642","rental_period":null,"current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"off-plan","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"11944","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Patrick-Tohme-PFB.jpg","name":"Patrick Tohme","email":"patrick@providentestate.com","phone":"+971 54 995 5162","brn_number":"84608"},"developer":"","ggfx_results":[{"id":5735213,"src_cftle":"i/property/PS-03122514/images/iblock/ca3/va8kblphxn2v23zwxf8h4q614yl8vv49/download.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/property/PS-03122514/images/iblock/ca3/va8kblphxn2v23zwxf8h4q614yl8vv49/340x252/download.webp","alias":"images","format":"w